<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>我的语音</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>总开关</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>微信文字转语音：捕获你输入的文字，用系统语音或你克隆的音色合成语音消息发出。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>发送方式</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>自动＝点「发送」后直接调微信内部录音接口把语音发出去，全程不弹「按住说话」界面、不用你按住（推荐）。关掉＝回到老方式：先合成，再由你自己在聊天页按住「按住 说话」、松开才发送。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>自动发送（无需按住说话）</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>autoSend</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>合成引擎</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>离线＝系统中文语音（机器人音，免费、不联网）；云端＝联网合成。选「云端」后请在下面「云端服务」里二选一；若你开了下面「自建服务器」，克隆音色会改走你自己的电脑（免费）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSegmentCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>引擎</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>engineMode</string>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<integer>0</integer>
				<integer>1</integer>
			</array>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>离线</string>
				<string>云端</string>
			</array>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>1</integer>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>发音通道（三选一 · 互斥）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>这里决定「声音从哪来」。三条路互斥，同一时刻只会走一条：① 自建·免费＝你自己电脑上跑 CosyVoice，免费、完全不碰阿里云、不耗 API Key；② 云端Cosy＝阿里云百炼的 CosyVoice，适合克隆/设计音色，按量计费；③ 云端千问＝阿里云百炼官方预置音色，不用克隆、开箱即用，按量计费。⚠️ 选①时千问一律不参与，所以不会出现"开了免费模式还在扣额度"。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSegmentCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>发音通道</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ttsChannel</string>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<integer>0</integer>
				<integer>1</integer>
				<integer>2</integer>
			</array>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>自建·免费</string>
				<string>云端Cosy</string>
				<string>云端千问</string>
			</array>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>2</integer>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>自建服务器（仅通道选「自建·免费」时生效）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>通道选「自建·免费」后，克隆 / CosyVoice 音色改走你自建的服务器（本地电脑跑模型 + 阿里云 ECS 中转），免费、不消耗 API Key 额度。地址填 ECS 中转后的公网地址，形如 http://你的公网IP:端口 —— 出于安全，界面与日志里只显示脱密形式（如 http://1.2.*.*:18000），完整地址只存在本机设置里。⚠️ 首次开启或换了地址后，要回微信悬浮球点「＋音色管理」重新复刻一次克隆音色（参考音频会存在手机本机）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>服务器地址</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>selfHostURL</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>http://你的公网IP:端口</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>访问令牌（可选）</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>selfHostToken</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>isPassword</key>
			<true/>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>与服务端 API_TOKEN 一致；没设就留空</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>千问音色</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>qwenVoice</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>Cherry</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>如 Cherry / Ethan / Dylan</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>千问模型</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>qwenModel</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>qwen3-tts-flash</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>qwen3-tts-flash</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>指令强化（2.8.8 起）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开关打开时，所有云端合成指令前面会加一句「务必严格按照以下指令执行」。实验反复证实：模型对"强化前缀"普遍更敏感，音色/方言/风格效果都明显更稳。默认开。要纯靠风格/方言本身指令的，可以关掉试试。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>指令强化前缀</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>reinforceInstruction</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>怎么创建音色（两种方式）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>在微信里做（设置里没有麦克风权限）：打开微信任意聊天 → 点悬浮球 “语” → 点“音色管理”。① 文字设计：填一句描述（如“沉稳的中年男性播音员”）→ 生成音色，不需要录音。② 录音复刻：朗读 15~30 秒干声，自动复刻。两种方式都不需要 OSS。创建后在悬浮球面板里选音色即可。</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>阿里云百炼 DashScope（云端合成用；开了自建服务器可留空）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>只有「走阿里云合成」时才需要：到 bailian.console.aliyun.com 开通，右上角地域选【华北2 北京】，底部“API Key”卡片创建（sk- 开头，创建时只显示一次）。Key 只存在本机。若已开启【自建服务器】，克隆音色走你自己的电脑，这一项可以完全不填；但千问预置音色仍需用它。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>API Key</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>apiKey</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>isPassword</key>
			<true/>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>sk-xxxxxxxx</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>workspace（选填）</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>workspace</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>留空即可，除非你用了子业务空间</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>测试 API Key 是否可用</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>testAPIKey</string>
		</dict>


		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>高级</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>一般无需改。若发送语音失败，先用 frida 确认微信内 sendVoiceToWeChat:toUsr: 所在类名（可留空自动探测）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>sendClass</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>sendClass</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>留空自动探测</string>
		</dict>
<dict>
	<key>cell</key>
	<string>PSGroupCell</string>
	<key>label</key>
	<string>诊断（排查用）</string>
	<key>footerText</key>
	<string>下面这个开关只在抓包排查时需要打开。默认关闭——关闭时插件在 QQ 里不会为每次点击采集视图树/手势，也不写日志（省电、不拖慢点击）。</string>
</dict>
<dict>
	<key>cell</key>
	<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
	<key>label</key>
	<string>记录触摸诊断（仅 QQ）</string>
	<key>key</key>
	<string>diagTapLog</string>
	<key>default</key>
	<false/>
	<key>PostNotification</key>
	<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
</dict>

	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
